Description: C implementation of Radicle CLI and Node
 Cradicle is a C implementation of the Radicle decentralized P2P code
 collaboration tool. It provides a CLI (crad) and a node wrapper that
 runs the Radicle heartwood node inside a Bubblewrap sandbox with
 optional Tor support for private repositories.
